      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SALSA (2) finished in the minors last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 366m at Capalaba, taking a Grade 5 in a sharp 19.81. Smart win two back and looks a key chance here. TOP THE LOT (7) goes very well at the course and distance with six wins and a placing from eight starts. Comes off a (19.13) win last time, scoring by 3.5 lengths in a Grade 5 over 350m at this track. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. UNDENIABLE GRIT (6) doesn't win out of turn. Finished second (19.57) at this track latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Solid record at the distance winning two races. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Leading chance. TITANIUM BLUE (4) took charge early and was never headed last time out. Will be thereabouts.",
